<div class="side-box-flex">
<div class="side-box-image"><span class="noviewer" typeof="mw:File"><a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Commons-logo.svg" class="mw-file-description"><img resource="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File:Commons-logo.svg" src="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/4/4a/Commons-logo.svg/40px-Commons-logo.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="//thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/4/4a/Commons-logo.svg/60px-Commons-logo.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x" alt="Wikimedia Commons logo" data-file-width="1024" data-file-height="1376" data-file-type="drawing" height="40" width="30" class="mw-file-element"/></a></span></div>
<div class="side-box-text plainlist">Wikimedia Commons has media related to <wbr/><i><b><a rel="mw:WikiLink/Interwiki" href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Centuries" title="commons:Category:Centuries" class="extiw">Centuries</a></b></i> and <wbr/><i><b><a rel="mw:WikiLink/Interwiki" href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Centennials" title="commons:Category:Centennials" class="extiw">Centennials</a></b></i>.</div></div>
</div>
<ul id="mw_A"><li id="mw_Q"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Age_of_Discovery" title="Age of Discovery" id="mw_g">Age of Discovery</a></li>
<li id="mw_w"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ancient_history" title="Ancient history" id="mwAQA">Ancient history</a></li>
<li id="mwAQE"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Before_Christ" title="Before Christ" class="mw-redirect" id="mwAQI">Before Christ</a> and <a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anno_Domini" title="Anno Domini" id="mwAQM">Anno Domini</a></li>
<li id="mwAQQ"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Common_Era" title="Common Era" id="mwAQU">Common Era</a></li>
<li id="mwAQY"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Decade" title="Decade" id="mwAQc">Decade</a></li>
<li id="mwAQg"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_decades,_centuries,_and_millennia" title="List of decades, centuries, and millennia" id="mwAQk">List of decades, centuries, and millennia</a></li>
<li id="mwAQo"><a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lustrum" title="Lustrum" id="mwAQs">Lustrum</a></li>
